{
  "sn7.14:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 7.14 ",
  "sn7.14:0.2": "2. Upāsakavagga ",
  "sn7.14:0.3": "Mahāsālasutta ",
  "sn7.14:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn7.14:1.2": "Atha kho aññataro brāhmaṇamahāsālo lūkho lūkhapāvuraṇo yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṁ sammodi. ",
  "sn7.14:1.3": "Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinnaṁ kho taṁ brāhmaṇamahāsālaṁ bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "sn7.14:1.4": "“kiṁ nu tvaṁ, brāhmaṇa, lūkho lūkhapāvuraṇo”ti? ",
  "sn7.14:1.5": "“Idha me, bho gotama, cattāro puttā. ",
  "sn7.14:1.6": "Te maṁ dārehi sampuccha gharā nikkhāmentī”ti. ",
  "sn7.14:1.7": "“Tena hi tvaṁ, brāhmaṇa, imā gāthāyo pariyāpuṇitvā sabhāyaṁ mahājanakāye sannipatite puttesu ca sannisinnesu bhāsassu: ",
  "sn7.14:2.1": "‘Yehi jātehi nandissaṁ, ",
  "sn7.14:2.2": "yesañca bhavamicchisaṁ; ",
  "sn7.14:2.3": "Te maṁ dārehi sampuccha, ",
  "sn7.14:2.4": "sāva vārenti sūkaraṁ. ",
  "sn7.14:3.1": "Asantā kira maṁ jammā, ",
  "sn7.14:3.2": "tāta tātāti bhāsare; ",
  "sn7.14:3.3": "Rakkhasā puttarūpena, ",
  "sn7.14:3.4": "te jahanti vayogataṁ. ",
  "sn7.14:4.1": "Assova jiṇṇo nibbhogo, ",
  "sn7.14:4.2": "khādanā apanīyati; ",
  "sn7.14:4.3": "Bālakānaṁ pitā thero, ",
  "sn7.14:4.4": "parāgāresu bhikkhati. ",
  "sn7.14:5.1": "Daṇḍova kira me seyyo, ",
  "sn7.14:5.2": "yañce puttā anassavā; ",
  "sn7.14:5.3":